  alemassimo/TAOSW.DSC_Decoder        DSC-from-audio decoder
  kywalda/dsc_generator               DSC test-message generator
  pd0wm/navtex                        NAVTEX decoder
  Nite01007/RadioTranscriber          scanner audio -> Whisper
  ggml-org/whisper.cpp                on-device speech-to-text (MIT)
  sansastra/Anomaly-Detection         AIS anomaly heuristics (reference)
  M0r13n/pyais                        AIS decoding (MIT)
